cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If CommsEv contributes to published work, please cite it as below.
title: "CommsEv: a command-and-control resilience testbed for multi-agent fleets under jamming and GNSS denial"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hurford
    given-names: William
    affiliation: Loughborough University
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/wjhurford/CommsEv
abstract: >-
  A deterministic testbed that carries RF propagation and jamming through link
  state, command authority and agent behaviour to mission outcome, with
  authority (who decides) and routing (how messages travel) as independent
  axes. Built at Loughborough University's LUCAS Lab.
